      "claim": "A parent reports that the app collects personal data from children under 13 without parental consent.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Apple is also accused of knowingly allowing developers to collect personal data from children under 13 without parental consent, despite having actual knowledge of the user’s age."
    },
